{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45420","headline":"寺中柿树一蒂四颗咏应制 · 广宣","name":"寺中柿树一蒂四颗咏应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍木生奇亩，低枝拂梵宫。\n因开四界分，本自百花中。\n当夏阴涵绿，临秋色变红。\n君看药草喻，何减太阳功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}